sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent Client
    participant AuthMW as OIDCAuthMiddleware<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Server as RHOAIServer<br/>(FastMCP)
    participant PluginMgr as Plugin Manager<br/>(pluggy)
    participant Plugin as Domain Plugin<br/>(e.g. Notebooks)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Agent,ModelReg: Client Entry (MCP Transport: SSE or streamable-http)

    Agent->>AuthMW: MCP Request<br/>POST /mcp (Bearer Token)
    alt OIDC Enabled
        AuthMW->>AuthMW: Validate Bearer Token<br/>(JWKS JWT or TokenReview)
        AuthMW->>AuthMW: Set UserContext<br/>(user identity + impersonation)
    end
    AuthMW->>Server: Authenticated MCP Request

    Note over Server,Plugin: Tool Dispatch

    Server->>PluginMgr: Route MCP tool call
    alt OIDC Enabled (RBAC Filtering)
        PluginMgr->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check user permissions)
        K8sAPI-->>PluginMgr: Allowed/Denied
    end
    PluginMgr->>Plugin: Execute tool handler

    Note over Plugin,ModelReg: Downstream Interactions

    alt Notebook Operations
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: CRUD Notebook CR<br/>(kubeflow.org/v1)
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Notebook status
    end

    alt Model Serving Operations
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService CR<br/>(serving.kserve.io)
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: InferenceService state
    end

    alt Training Operations
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: CRUD TrainJob CR<br/>(trainer.kubeflow.org)
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: TrainJob status
    end

    alt Pipeline Operations
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: CRUD DSPA CR<br/>(opendatahub.io)
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Pipeline status
    end

    alt Model Registry Operations
        Plugin->>ModelReg: HTTP GET/POST<br/>(model metadata)
        ModelReg-->>Plugin: Model artifacts/metadata
    end

    Plugin-->>PluginMgr: Tool result
    PluginMgr-->>Server: MCP response
    Server-->>AuthMW: Response
    AuthMW-->>Agent: MCP Tool Result

    Note over Agent,AuthMW: Health Check (unauthenticated)
    Agent->>Server: GET /health
    Server-->>Agent: 200 OK
